This tarball should contain 3 directories:

 2) "unpolarized_RC" : Modified code. For use with unpolarized cross sections.

 3) "polarized_RC"   : Modified code. For use with polarized cross sections.

 3) "original_code"  : Contains Whitney's original SLAC code for comparison.


For complete description of modifications see:
http://www.jlab.org/~slifer/codes.html
